Cell["Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c8f7ae62-2408-41d1-8fe4-76ecf1146a15"],

Cell["\<\
The coordinates live in SyntheticInfrageometry; the radar map \
RadarCoordinates lives in the sibling Infrageometry paclet, which \
SyntheticInfrageometry extends with the InfraPoint / InfraSet overloads used \
below.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8503b264-72a3-46f4-b0f8-baea4823245b"],

Cell["\<\
Needs[\"WolframInstitute`SyntheticInfrageometry`\"];
Needs[\"WolframInstitute`Infrageometry`\"];\
\>", "Code",
 InitializationCell->
